ru needs Shinjirou, their prince, to return home to Mount Kurama and stop the tyranny of Jirou, who has taken over the rule of their hometown. However, Nanami soon discovers a force much darker than Jirou is at work on the mountain.\n<br><br>\nAs a fledgling god becoming more accustomed to divinity, Nanami finds herself dealing with a tengu rebellion, her blooming feelings for Tomoe, and a strange man with ties to both Tomoe's past and Nanami's future.\n<br><br>\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":31,"month":3,"year":2015},"episodes":12,"externalLinks":[{"language":null,"site":"Hulu","type":"STREAMING","url":"http://www.hulu.com/kamisama-kiss"},{"language":null,"site":"Crunchyroll","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/kamisama-hajimemashita"},{"language":null,"site":"Amazon Prime Video","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/-/es/detail/0SGK2W00NQ6AMCTMAWEGC9DLGE/ref=atv_dp_season_select_s2"},{"language":null,"site":"Netflix","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.netflix.com/title/80070071"}],"genres":["Comedy","Fantasy","Romance","Supernatural"],"hashtag":"#mikagesha","isLicensed":true,"meanScore":82,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":true,"context":"highest rated all time","format":"TV","rank":214,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":null},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":8,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":2015},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":43,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2015},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":2,"season":"WINTER","type":"RATED","year":2015},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":10,"season":"WINTER","type":"POPULAR","year":2015}],"relations":[["PREQUEL",14713,14713,"ANIME","TV"],["SIDE_STORY",21186,30709,"ANIME","OVA"],["SOURCE",38157,8157,"MANGA","MANGA"]],"season":"WINTER","seasonYear":2015,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":6,"month":1,"year":2015},"sta